IO-39: write each unknown-section warning once

SWMMEngine::open() inserted each unknown-section warning into ctx_.warnings
and sent it to the warning callback, then did both again through
push_report_warning(), to reproduce the 5.3.0 reader's two copies. The
report therefore showed the warning twice and swmm_get_warning_count()
counted it twice. Drop the second copy, matching the 5.3.0 patch.

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b:
    git apply IO-39_swmm600.patch

diff --git a/src/engine/core/SWMMEngine.cpp b/src/engine/core/SWMMEngine.cpp
